        "value": "18.8–22.4 秒，夏至秋；主树18.8–19.3秒下蹲，秋波19.3–21.9秒扩散。"
      },
      {
        "name": "重复节拍",
        "value": "film/main.js:WAVES：另两次波为9.3–11.9、29.3–31.9秒；source/music.py 在每个 T−.42 秒低击、T 时回弹并上行。"
      }
    ],
    "parameters": [
      {
        "name": "压缩与回弹",
        "value": "film/main.js:place：sy=1−.2*io(seg(t,T−.5,T))，T 后 .6 秒 backOut(.8→1)；横向scale=1/√sy。"
      },
      {
        "name": "波半径与延迟",
        "value": "film/main.js:seasonState / passed：WAVE_MAX=240，r=240*io(seg(t,t0,t1))，progress=clamp((r−distance)/(16*len))。"
      },
      {
        "name": "材质换色",
        "value": "film/memphis.js:FLAT_FS：uHasC2>.5 且 length(vWP.xz−uSeas.xy)<uSeas.z 时选择 uCol2 / uPatCol2。"
      }
